{"id":"vod_bf_43166","vodId":"43166","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"一周的朋友2014","name_cn":"一周的朋友2014","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-44/ce6102d92c26ea12e92d0b0bad26cc98.jpg"},"summary":"表面上看来，藤宫香织（雨宫天 配音）是一个再平凡不过的高中少女，然而，很少有人知道，一种罕见的疾病让香织的记忆只能维持一周的时间。曾经感情要好的朋友、让人快乐的事情，只要一周的时间一到，就会统统忘记，背负着这样的痛苦，香织压抑了自己的感情，带上了冷酷的假面，过着离群索居的孤独生活。　　香织诡异的性格让开朗乐观的男孩长谷佑树（山谷祥生 配音）感到十分好奇，他主动接近香织，提出了要成为朋友的请求。得知了香织的病情，佑树并没有退却，周复一周，他凭借着自己的善意，一次又一次地和香织成为了朋友，随着时间的推移，一种坚实的羁绊在两个年轻善良的孩子之间产生了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:09:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yizhoudepengyou2014/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:50.870Z"}